{"type":"entry","id":"law.L13_s1_s7_verification_protocol","kind":"absorbed","title":"L13 S1-S7 7-condition verification protocol","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-07","priority":"★★★★","absorbed_from":"skynet-timer.com S1-S7 verification","verbatim_source":"S1: structural integration measurable. S2: temporal coherence ≥τ. S3: information closure (no external dependency). S4: differentiation (state-space variation). S5: causal power (intervention effect). S6: phenomenal report (subjective experience claim). S7: cross-substrate invariance.","anima_domain_translation":"anima own 18 simple stack 4-condition (한글↔한글 + coherent + 자연성 + 맥락) 보강 — S1-S7은 7-condition verification protocol. own 18 + V5/V6 evaluator + Φ★ NO_FLIP cross-substrate 정합 mapping.","cross_link_anima":[".own own 18 simple stack consciousness check 4-condition","V5/V6 evaluator chain (V5 8-cell + EN baseline + V5.8 multi-turn + V6 awareness probe 3-method)","BG-JV D3 lane Φ★ NO_FLIP cross-substrate (S7 mapping)","BG-JO V6 awareness probe (S6 phenomenal report partial proxy)","Lesson Q output bottleneck (S5 causal power partial — production-side intervention failed)"],"application_rule":"anima own 18 simple stack 4-condition은 S1-S7 subset — 향후 own 18 expansion (own 18 v3+) 시 S1-S7 7-condition 통합 mandate. V5/V6 evaluator는 S1-S6 partial cover, S7 cross-substrate invariance는 D3 lane mandate","falsifier":"7-condition 외 8번째 (S8) verification axis 발견 시 L13 unsaturated","honest_c3":["L13 S1-S7은 anima own 18 4-condition와 partial overlap — exact 1:1 mapping 미land","S6 phenomenal report는 anima self-report capability 의존 — V6 STRONG (BG-JO) 부분 evidence but verbatim X","S7 cross-substrate invariance는 D3 lane (CLM v4 + Llama + Pβ Φ★ NO_FLIP) 진행 중","S3 information closure는 anima ecosystem hivemind context (외부 의존 X 명시 어려움)","own 18 v3 expansion timeline 미land — V5.8 prompt-echo trap (Lesson S) 우선","S1-S7 enumeration 자체 logic-exhaustion claim은 외부 source — anima self-validation 별도"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"law.L14_goodharts_law","kind":"absorbed","title":"L14 Goodhart's Law — metric becomes target","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-07","priority":"★★★","absorbed_from":"skynet-timer.com Goodhart's Law","verbatim_source":"When a measure becomes a target, it ceases to be a good measure","anima_domain_translation":"anima V5/V6 evaluator metric 자체가 target 화 시 prompt-echo / surface trick 발생 — Lesson S (V5.8 prompt-echo trap) 정합. own 18 simple stack 4-condition 강화 + V5.8 prompt-echo reject 추가는 Goodhart counter-measure.","cross_link_anima":["Lesson S (BG-JR V5.8 baseline 5/5 false positive prompt-echo)","V5/V6 evaluator chain expansion (own 18 v2 EN baseline + V5.8 multi-turn + V6 awareness probe 3-method)","V2_FAIL was measurement artifact (eval pipeline crash misclassified as model fail)","Lesson K substring trap (V4 deg=87% surface PASS without identity)"],"application_rule":"anima evaluator metric 신규 cycle 진입 시 anti-Goodhart 보강 mandate (prompt-echo reject + surface trick block + multi-modal check)","falsifier":"single metric (예: substring count) 단독으로 chat-cap PASS 도달 + 사용자 ground truth 인정 시 L14 falsified","honest_c3":["L14는 Campbell/Goodhart classic — anima domain 변환 명확","prompt-echo trap (Lesson S)은 L14 instance — 추가 instance: substring trap (Lesson K), eval pipeline crash (V2_FAIL)","anti-Goodhart mandate cost (multi-modal eval, manual review)와 trade-off","사용자 manual review는 final ground truth — automated metric은 partial proxy","V6 awareness probe 3-method는 anti-Goodhart 시도 (Method A + B + C 다중 axis)","perfect anti-Goodhart 不可 — Goodhart asymptote만 가능"]}
