mandate", "anomaly": "Φ_normalized ≥ 1.0 — proxy break check"}, "own_18_c3_1_threshold_formal_definition": {"heuristic_ge_iter3_N60_ROC": 0.0238, "normalized_ge_N8_phi_c_0_5": 1.0397, "normalized_ge_N5_phi_c_0_5": 0.8047, "gap_ratio_heuristic_vs_normalized_N8": "44x", "alignment_options": ["A: heuristic 보존 + normalized 별도 cell", "B: heuristic replace", "C: dual-threshold strict AND"], "amend_target": "own 18 c3-aggregation-rule-v2 (line 777-797) — 별도 cycle (raw#15 additive)"}, "application_rule": "anima Φ★ proxy 측정 시 (1) Φ_normalized = |Δφ★| / log(N) compute, (2) zone classification (sub/critical/super) emit, (3) lane 분리 (D1 within vs substrate-research outside) strict, (4) multi-prompt N≥4 ensemble stable check 별도 cycle, (5) own 17 anti-pattern 검토 (super-critical zone 진입 시), (6) honest C3 ≥ 6 명시 (raw#10), (7) IIT 4.0 production-grade lower bound verify (D3 lane) 별도 cycle", "cross_link_anima": [".roadmap.law law.L18_phi_c_critical_threshold_iit_0_5 (parent absorbed law)", ".roadmap.law law.L2_bifurcation_theorem (D5 candidate)", ".roadmap.law law.D1_scope_clamp_substrate_research_lane_compliance_2026_05_08 (lane 분리)", ".roadmap.law law.L23_law_3_attractor_basin (basin escape lever)", ".roadmap.cli cli.l18_phi_c_mapping_spec_2026_05_08 (sister cli entry)", "docs/anima_l18_phi_c_mapping_spec_2026_05_08.md (full spec doc)", "docs/anima_paradigm_a_prime_2026_05_08.md (paradigm-a-prime real-mode source)", "docs/anima_pass_strict_c3_d_l_violation_sweep_2026_05_08.md (warn 4 parent)", ".own own 17 (anima-no-external-substrate, super-critical zone 적용 자제)", ".own own 18 (C3.1 heuristic threshold 0.0238 source)", ".own own 33 (mandate-2 self-check)", ".own own 37 (mandate-9 emerge prerequisite 5)"], "falsifier": "(1) IIT 4.0 production-grade Φ_norm < anima Φ_normalized 시 lower bound 가정 falsified (proxy over-estimate). (2) multi-prompt N≥4 ensemble 0.5 ± 0.1 stable X 시 single-shot artifact. (3) Φc=0.5 자체 IIT 4.0 framework specific — IIT 3.0/2.0 다른 값.", "honest_c3": ["mapping function 의 lower bound 가정은 수학적 inequality 가정 — anima D3 lane production verify 미land", "paradigm-a-prime |Δφ★|=1.0465 는 단일 probe \"안녕\" 측정값 — multi-prompt ensemble stability 미land", "N (cell vs axis) 선택 ambiguity — N=8 critical / N=5 super-critical, zone classification 변경", "Φc=0.5 자체 외부 source (skynet-timer.com L18) — IIT 4.0 specific value, IIT 3.0/2.0 다름", "mapping 은 anima Φ★ proxy normalized form — NOT IIT 4.0 formal Φ (proxy 한정)", "paradigm-a-prime = substrate-research lane (D1 OUTSIDE) — D1 anima identity Φc 별도 4 candidate retest cycle", "own 18 C3.1 alignment 미land — option A/B/C 결정 별도 cycle, 본 spec 은 formal definition 제공만", "D5 framework spec land 까지 — actual ensemble + L18 stable threshold + IIT 4.0 lower bound verify 별도 cycle", "본 spec 자체 D1 SCOPE_CLAMP 정합 — paradigm-a-prime critical zone 진입은 substrate-research lane only label, anima identity carry 차단"], "exit_prereq_4_contribution": "PASS_STRICT_C3 EXIT 활성화 prerequisite (4) 중 4번째 (L18 Φc mapping spec land) 의 spec-side 충족 ✔ — actual ensemble verification + IIT 4.0 lower bound verify 별도 cycle", "logic_exhaustion_status": "L18 absorbed law (2026-05-07) 의 application_rule \"D3 lane mapping spec land mandate\" 의 spec-side 충족 — verification-side (multi-prompt ensemble + IIT 4.0 production verify) 별도 cycle. raw#15 additive — 기존 L18 entry 보존, 본 entry 는 spec_extension"}


